["displayText"] = "露露的鼠标指向宏\n\n#showtooltip 真言术：盾\n/cast [mod,@player] [@mouseover,help,nodead][help,nodead][nogroup,@player] [@targettarget,help,nodead][]真言术：盾\n\n#showtooltip 驱散魔法\n/cast [@mouseover,exists][] 驱散魔法\n\n#showtooltip 暗影魔\n/cast [harm][@targettarget,harm][] 暗影魔\n\n更新中\n",
